Welcome to your June DataVault Digest! This month, we’re excited to share some new features designed to make your data management even smoother, along with a few tips to help you get the most out of your DataVault experience.

**What’s New?**
- **Smart Sync for Teams**: Now available for all Business Plan users, Smart Sync ensures your team’s files are always up to date across all devices. [Learn more →](https://www.datavault.example/smart-sync)
- **Enhanced Search**: We’ve improved our search functionality to help you find files faster with better filtering options.

**This Month’s Tip: Organizing Your Vault**
A well-organized vault saves time and reduces stress. Try using our new **Custom Tags** feature to categorize your files by project, priority, or department. [Read our guide →](https://help.datavault.example/organizing-your-vault)

**Customer Spotlight**
This month, we’re featuring **Lumen Tech**, a fast-growing startup using DataVault to streamline their remote collaboration. [Read their story →](https://www.datavault.example/customer-stories/lumen-tech)

**Upcoming Webinar**
Join us on **June 20th at 11 AM PT** for a live demo of our new Smart Sync feature. [Register here →](https://www.datavault.example/webinars/smart-sync-demo)

